---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: Legion operator invokes publishSaleResults(claimRoot, acceptedRoot, totalTokens, decimals)
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not Legion operator
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_time: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_time --> q_revert_time: now < refundEndTime
    q_revert_time --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodActive
    q_check_time --> q_check_published: now >= refundEndTime
    q_check_published --> q_revert_dup: results already published
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert AlreadyPublished
    q_check_published --> q_set_roots: results not yet published
    q_set_roots --> q_set_totals: claimMerkleRoot = claimRoot; acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot = acceptedRoot
    q_set_totals --> [*]: totalTokensAllocated = totalTokens; emit SaleResultsPublished()

    note right of q_check_auth
        INV-001: Only Legion operators can publish sale results
        INV-002: Results can only be published after refund period ends
        INV-003: Results can only be published once
    end note
